<view class="page-container">
  <van-toast id="van-toast" />
  <!-- 自定义顶部导航栏 -->
  <nav-bar id="nav-bar" />
  <view class="carousel">
    <swiper indicator-dots="{{indicatorDots}}" autoplay="{{autoplay}}" interval="{{interval}}" duration="{{duration}}">
      <block wx:for="{{background}}" wx:key="*this">
        <swiper-item>
          <view class="swiper-item {{item}}">{{item}}</view>
        </swiper-item>
      </block>
    </swiper>

    <view class="hero-section">
      <view class="info-title">
        <view class="hero-title">岳麓山风景区 观光车</view>
        <view class="btn-guide">乘车指南</view>
      </view>
      <view class="info-list">
        <view class="info-item"><i class="info-icon icon-clock"></i>
          <view class="info-text">开放时间 8:30-20:00(南门线路，运营17:30结束)</view>
        </view>
        <view class="info-item">
          <view class="info-text">咨询电话 0731-82294576</view>
        </view>
      </view>

    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="main">
    <view class=" main-content">
      <view class="vanTab">
        <van-tabs active="{{ active }}" bind:change="onChangeType" color="#336633">
          <van-tab title="普通票"></van-tab>
          <van-tab title="学生票"></van-tab>
          <van-tab title="优惠票"></van-tab>
          <van-tab title="包车服务"></van-tab>
        </van-tabs>
      </view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y style="height: 1100rpx;">
        <view class="ticket-list">
          <view wx:if="{{hint}}">
            <view class="ticket-card " wx:for="{{scenicBusList}}" wx:key="*this">
              <view class="ticket-header">
                <span class="ticket-icon">🎫</span>
                <span class="ticket-title">{{item.title}}</span>
              </view>
              <view class="ticket-route">
                <view class="route-station-start">{{item.startStation}}</view>
                <view class="route-arrow_tag">123</view>
                <view class="route-station-end">{{item.endStation}}</view>
              </view>
              <div class="ticket-footer">
                <div class="ticket-price">
                  <view class="discountedPrice">
                    <span class="price-symbol">¥</span>
                    <span class="price-number">{{item.price}}</span>
                  </view>
                  <view class="sellingPrice">
                    <span class="price-number">¥{{item.originalPrice}}</span>
                  </view>
                </div>
                <view class="{{item.cannot ? 'cannot' : 'btn-buy'}}" bindtap="onBuy" data-item="{{item}}" data-cannot="{{item.cannot}}">
                  立即购买
                </view>
              </div>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="hint" wx:else>

            <view class="search">
              <image src="../../assets/image/search.png" mode="" />
              <text>暂无车票</text>
            </view>

          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="notice-text">
          温馨提示:1、每款票种点立即购票后将会出现详细的乘车须知，请核对清楚后再进行购票:2、免票政策:1.2米以下孩童且未单独占座:3、双程票停票时间为营运截止前一个半小时，特殊情况需停票时见停票通知。4、观光车排队区域暂未设定军人、未成年人、老年人、残疾人等特殊人群的优先通道，请各位游客按秩序排队乘坐。
        </text>
      </scroll-view>
    </view>
  </view>


  <!-- 提示框   -->
  <van-popup show="{{ show }}" bind:close="onClose" round custom-style="overflow: visible;">
    <view class="promptBox">
      <view class="ticket_icon">
        <image src="../../assets/image/ticket.png" mode="" />
      </view>
      <view class="ticket_title">购票须知</view>
      <view class="ticket_text">
        <view>1，实名购票，一人一票，当日有效，过期作废。</view>
        <view>2，1.2米以下儿童免票（需成人陪同），1.2—1.5米儿童半价。</view>
        <view>3，按线路站点候车乘车，服从引导，严禁携带危险品。</view>
        <view>4，车票售出不退不换，遗失不补，停运可退改。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="agree" bind:tap="agree">我已阅读并同意上述须知</view>
    </view>
  </van-popup>


  <van-popup show="{{ buyShow }}" round position="bottom" custom-style="height: 71%" bind:close="onClose">
    <view class="ticket-dialog">
      <view class="dialog-header">
        <text class="dialog-title">{{ticketDetails.title}}</text>
        <van-icon name="cross" color="black" size="20px" bind:tap="onClose" />
      </view>
      <view class="ticket-price">¥{{ticketDetails.price}}</view>

      <view class="ticket-action-bar">
        <view class="ticket-tag">
          <view class="tag-name">成人票</view>
          <view class="tag-desc">1人/1次</view>
        </view>
        <view class="stepper">
          <view class="stepper-btn-minus" bind:tap="btnMinus">
            <image src="../../assets/image/minus.png" mode="" />
          </view>
          <view class="stepper-num">
            <input type="text" value="{{quantity}}" bind:input="onChange" />
          </view>
          <view class="stepper-btn-plus" bind:tap="btnPlus">
            <image src="../../assets/image/plus.png" mode="" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="thread"></view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y style="height: 730rpx;">
        <view class="text-box">
          <mp-html content="{{ticketDetails.description}}" />
        </view>
      </scroll-view>


      <view class="dialog-footer">
        <view class="total-price-box">
          <text class="total-label">合计</text>
          <text class="total-symbol">¥</text>
          <text class="total-num">{{totalPrice}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pay-btn">支付</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </van-popup>
</view>